  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment of the Ethiopian Human Rights Commission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The funding is intended to support empowerment of the Ethiopian Human Rights Council (EHRC) through DIHR so as to capacitate it to conduct independent human rights investigations to hold accountable those who have committed human rights abuses.</narrative>
  </description>
